From f11d58c101112b8b53550a3ceb8fab3dc5806ab1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Izzy Mansurov <47342870+sapoepsilon@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 10:51:12 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] vmapple on KVM (Asahi): port aquarat/qemu-reims-vgpu
 c6d87a8406's KVM work onto steelbrain 1b41f5f5db

This is a whole-file port of the vmapple-on-KVM work in
https://github.com/aquarat/qemu-reims-vgpu (c6d87a8406), including Anees
Iqbal's original vmapple KVM commit (7f39007f9a) and Mohamed Mediouni's
RFC v7 "vmapple: make it work on the latest macOS release". Authorship of
that code stays with them; this patch only rebases it onto
steelbrain/qemu-reims-vgpu 1b41f5f5db. GPL-2.0-or-later, as QEMU.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
